<title>The Philippines: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/philippines/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-philippines-2026-10-28T23:22:54.036Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 28 Oct 2026 23:22:54 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Coast Guard bomb experts were wounded when explosives detonated inside their Zamboanga City barracks, and two other Coast Guard members were injured in a separate blast at the same location. The Philippine Coast Guard placed a five-day heightened alert for the Undas period, deployed personnel to rescue a distressed vessel in Tawi-Tawi, and prepared a large police deployment of over 72,000 personnel for the holiday. The Armed Forces of the Philippines monitored 54 Chinese vessels, including a carrier, transiting West Philippine Sea features from Oct. 20 to 26, and said the carrier passage off Mindanao was not a cause for alarm. Cyclone Arnab caused a Philippine ship to drift to the Konaseema coast, resulting in three deaths. 176 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxPME16eWRRMThHQ1h0UDZydzJrSkE0UjAyUXFXVjhzc0ZuWUR3YVNKZkZNNmJZZzVIY19pT2JwSUhUT2htZEpZMkxnMmNyNTY1RWpIYU5DRnpWNHNIMnlaMklPWlJXZURBQ00zM2d1TEFIamhYT2NzRHY0MW9RR3RoTUJ0VVZPWHF2dnVHelRhUG9LRk9rTjZGRzhpcUhhbU1FVXh5WklERUdLUVBWSTNRUXJpWHk2bER6dFhtYnZUMA?oc=5&quot;&gt;BizPac Review&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Deccan Chronicle&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMid0FVX3lxTE9vT0FXS0pwclNVQWdhNXpFYUJZaWxRMXIwYVVDTWFIbU5DZUNybnJCRGpvVFMzbzVtS0dnUDZ4UHRPWmFldXRONnZTRVZPZThmOUdlX1hKZktKUGxXc3paeDhiaWZ0QWFFc0diYjhNRXlTUTNIQ1Vr?oc=5&quot;&gt;Taipei Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Philstar.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxPWm1yZk84VFBDZ0FmSlozM1d2ZWZZUmNzSERXMm9KZkF4YXYwTHp1TDk5c3VSLWViMTFyZExMYmNVZ1VBcVMzdHNaTVhNTHBqUkp6NmxTc1lOZkRXTERhd01GVmtHWWx6VnBBT1lHR2E4a21KYzZsNW8tZ1dNNlBZUkRiamp3VU1FX0FoNlMxemZmNDlfQWkzNl9I